    "icon": "data:image/svg+xml;utf8,%3Csvg%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20100%20100%22%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%3E%0A%20%20%3Cdefs%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%3Cfilter%20id%3D%22neon-glow%22%20x%3D%22-50%25%22%20y%3D%22-50%25%22%20width%3D%22200%25%22%20height%3D%22200%25%22%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%3CfeGaussianBlur%20stdDeviation%3D%221.8%22%20result%3D%22blur%22%20%2F%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%3CfeComposite%20in%3D%22SourceGraphic%22%20in2%3D%22blur%22%20operator%3D%22over%22%20%2F%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%3C%2Ffilter%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%3ClinearGradient%20id%3D%22leaf-grad%22%20x1%3D%220%25%22%20y1%3D%220%25%22%20x2%3D%22100%25%22%20y2%3D%22100%25%22%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%3Cstop%20offset%3D%220%25%22%20style%3D%22stop-color%3A%230a3d0a%3Bstop-opacity%3A1%22%20%2F%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%3Cstop%20offset%3D%22100%25%22%20style%3D%22stop-color%3A%23021a02%3Bstop-opacity%3A1%22%20%2F%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%3C%2FlinearGradient%3E%0A%20%20%3C%2Fdefs%3E%0A%20%20%0A%20%20%3C!--%20Background%20--%3E%0A%20%20%3Crect%20width%3D%22100%22%20height%3D%22100%22%20fill%3D%22%23010801%22%20%2F%3E%0A%20%20%0A%20%20%3C!--%20Stylized%20Organic%20Leaf%20Shape%20--%3E%0A%20%20%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M50%2015%20C75%2015%2085%2045%2050%2085%20C15%2045%2025%2015%2050%2015Z%22%20fill%3D%22url(%23leaf-grad)%22%20stroke%3D%22%230f5a0f%22%20stroke-width%3D%220.5%22%20%2F%3E%0A%20%20%0A%20%20%3C!--%20Cyber%20Veins%20(Neon%20Highlights)%20--%3E%0A%20%20%3Cg%20filter%3D%22url(%23neon-glow)%22%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%3C!--%20Main%20Stem%20--%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M50%2085%20L50%2025%22%20stroke%3D%22%2300ffcc%22%20stroke-width%3D%221.5%22%20fill%3D%22none%22%20stroke-linecap%3D%22round%22%20%2F%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%0A%20%20%20%20%3C!--%20Lateral%20Veins%20--%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M50%2070%20L75%2045%22%20stroke%3D%22%2300ffcc%22%20stroke-width%3D%221.2%22%20fill%3D%22none%22%20stroke-linecap%3D%22round%22%20%2F%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M50%2055%20L25%2035%22%20stroke%3D%22%23bcff00%22%20stroke-width%3D%221.2%22%20fill%3D%22none%22%20stroke-linecap%3D%22round%22%20%2F%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M50%2040%20L70%2020%22%20stroke%3D%22%23bcff00%22%20stroke-width%3D%221%22%20fill%3D%22none%22%20stroke-linecap%3D%22round%22%20%2F%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M50%2025%20L35%2015%22%20stroke%3D%22%2300ffcc%22%20stroke-width%3D%220.8%22%20fill%3D%22none%22%20stroke-linecap%3D%22round%22%20%2F%3E%0A%20%20%3C%2Fg%3E%0A%20%20%0A%20%20%3C!--%20Floating%20Spores%2FData%20Points%20--%3E%0A%20%20%3Ccircle%20cx%3D%2220%22%20cy%3D%2225%22%20r%3D%221.5%22%20fill%3D%22%23bcff00%22%20filter%3D%22url(%23neon-glow)%22%20%2F%3E%0A%20%20%3Ccircle%20cx%3D%2285%22%20cy%3D%2260%22%20r%3D%221.2%22%20fill%3D%22%2300ffcc%22%20filter%3D%22url(%23neon-glow)%22%20%2F%3E%0A%20%20%3Ccircle%20cx%3D%2230%22%20cy%3D%2280%22%20r%3D%221%22%20fill%3D%22%23ff00ff%22%20filter%3D%22url(%23neon-glow)%22%20%2F%3E%0A%20%20%3Ccircle%20cx%3D%2275%22%20cy%3D%2220%22%20r%3D%220.8%22%20fill%3D%22%2300ffcc%22%20filter%3D%22url(%23neon-glow)%22%20%2F%3E%0A%3C%2Fsvg%3E",
    "commands": [
      "Apply Neon Nature"
